script = ExtResource("1_uw80n")
dialogue_id = "debate_final"
record_title = "The Final Debate Speech"
text = "PAGE: avatar_adult(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
avatar_adult: Many of you have waited for a long time to hear the will of the Enlightened One.
avatar_adult: I've waited my whole life for it too.
avatar_adult: When I first met the Historian she asked me if I was the Enlightened One.
avatar_adult: I said that although I wasn't, I could feel the divine will.
avatar_adult: But in my heart, all I felt was doubt.
avatar_adult: I felt broken, because I didn't hear the Enlightened One's words.
avatar_adult: We all feel broken sometimes, don't we?
avatar_adult: Recently, the Enlightened One's words finally reached me.
avatar_adult: At first, they made me feel more broken, because I knew I wouldn't bring the shards together.
avatar_adult: And because I knew they were the last words I would hear from the Enlightened One.
avatar_adult: But as I meditated on what they meant, I looked out across the Cloud Sea.
avatar_adult: Some of us see the New World as broken, but maybe it's just because we expect it to be different.
avatar_adult: If we stop looking at the past for how the world should be, we stop seeing a broken world.
avatar_adult: Look at what we have built on these floating shards.
avatar_adult: Ten thousand little worlds, each wonderful in its own way.
avatar_adult: The Scribe and the Historian have spent many afternoons sharing their wisdom with us.
avatar_adult: When a people can raise such thoughtful, caring voices, the leader's job is already done.
avatar_adult: I am sure the Enlightened One would want us to never stop debating and trying to make our world better.
avatar_adult: But today, the Enlightened One has found rest, content to live on in our hearts and the new stories we will compose.
avatar_adult: Let us turn over a new leaf.
avatar_adult: Instead of counting our years from the Shattering, let us call the next year the first of a new age.
avatar_adult: One where the Enlightened One speaks not through a single Avatar, but through each of us.
avatar_adult: It is a beautiful day in the Cloud Sea.
avatar_adult: I will step through the gate now, and find myself an ordinary life.
avatar_adult: I hope to be a good neighbor to you all."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
